SUMMARY:Deadline: Production Grant (Visual Arts)
DESCRIPTION:Pro Helvetia's visual arts production grant supports the creati
 on of new works by established visual artists\, photographers\, and archit
 ects with a cross-regional exhibition track record beyond their own langua
 ge region. ELIGIBILITY: requires a connection to Switzerland (Swiss citize
 nship\, or permanent residency with regular artistic activity in Switzerla
 nd)\; not open to practitioners without a Swiss connection. AMOUNT: maximu
 m CHF 25\,000. Submission deadline 1 September (23:59 CEST). Apply via the
