 Location: Cross-regionally established Switzerland-based visual artists\, 
 photographers\, and architects.\nAward: Maximum CHF 25\,000. No applicatio
 n fee.\nDuration: Creation of new works by established visual artists\; de
 adline 1 September.\n\nMore: https://prohelvetia.ch/en/find-support/produc
 tion-grant?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://prohelvetia.ch/en/find-support/production-grant?utm_source=arti
 ficialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
